(\ref{lemma_error_log}) We apply Titu's lemma, a variant of Cauchy-Schwartz, to the sequences $a_r:=\log(1+\widetilde{Q}_r)$ and $b_r:=\tfrac1{\alpha-r}$ for $r=0,\ldots,\alpha-1$. We get
